w concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)3000_900.png", "id": "429007318575366", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_429007321908699_4258283118475983943_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E34vm1Zv7oUQ7kNvwG7Y8qF&_nc_oc=AdmRD4cKjl5L-Oz5QF4qzNGz7xbkNG4v2OXmJo3FakyXOsad3Ax4YwrnmYE8K8qXLuY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy6SzVQ0BknW1B0LtOwt7mOk3WQxEfy6GPtTO_Gb7TFVQ&oe=69B0072A"}, {"file_name": "\ub354\ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\ub85c\uace0(\ud55c\uae00).png", "id": "3213236945564295", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_3213236948897628_4786406447797518072_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yL9JE1Z8vr4Q7kNvwE58PcZ&_nc_oc=Adk1BnW2v-L5etf0YcRdpux2V-UUhAT08c_zM0m19FtZp7CTXL9jcLR1e7yMikfgP7k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx98S1ToDzQff57Vr37eFUV_wwt_3kR7OSnrdEVr1dlyA&oe=69B019DE"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)2560_1440.png", "id": "1042171706627527", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75429288_1042171713294193_695814847444454466_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lLrn7xekPzwQ7kNvwGadYXQ&_nc_oc=AdmK-_EqasSkTnWOGgO5RiOwLVMY6p-hgGxq4ozb7jEtCf0v1VOMadjmqY3EC_4_xgc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzdU4cbLteZkyJdfMGSkgOszz640lUgaKSG4eSuwfZ-ew&oe=69B008B1"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)1080_360.png", "id": "9